#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:347
msgid "This site uses the MixMyMeals plugin. Everything below is processed within this website itself — that is, on the hosting described elsewhere in this policy. The plugin calls no service of its own and passes no visitor data to anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:349
msgid "Meal plan subscriptions: we store your e-mail address, an optional name, the plan you subscribed to, the times of your consent and confirmation, and an access token that the links in the e-mails use (double opt-in). You can unsubscribe at any time via the link in every e-mail."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:350
msgid "Ratings and reviews: logged-in users and subscribers following a personalised link can leave a star rating and a review. These are stored as a comment together with the name and e-mail address given."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:351
msgid "Meal photos: subscribers can upload photos of dishes they cooked, via a personalised link. The photo and the display name given are stored; embedded metadata (EXIF, including GPS coordinates) is removed on upload. Photos are reviewed before they appear publicly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:352
msgid "Meal planner: for visitors who are not logged in, a cookie stores a random identifier with no personal reference. The selection of recipes itself is stored on the server and deleted automatically after one week."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:353
msgid "Abuse protection: when subscribing, creating a meal plan or downloading a plan as a PDF, a hashed (pseudonymised) form of your IP address is stored as a short-lived counter — about a minute for PDFs, an hour for the others — and then deleted automatically."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:354
msgid "Send log: to trace delivery problems we keep a limited log of e-mails sent. It records metadata only — recipient address, subject, delivery status and time — never the message content, and older entries are dropped once the log is full."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:355
msgid "Suppression list: addresses that have unsubscribed are kept in an internal list so the objection is honoured permanently."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:366
msgid "This site also stores the IP address you subscribed from, in full, as proof of consent. It is kept with the subscription record and deleted with it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:368
msgid "How long subscription data is kept is configured on this site: unconfirmed sign-ups are deleted automatically after the confirmation window, confirmed and ended records after the configured retention period."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:369
msgid "You can request an export or deletion of your data via the WordPress tools under Tools → Export/Erase Personal Data."
msgstr ""

